# Test Intent: ConsentFirstVisit

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/consent-first-visit/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the page. On my first visit a cookie/consent dialog covered the page. I
clicked "Accept all" and it went away. Then I clicked "Open account report" and
saw the report text appear. When I revisited in the same browser session the
dialog did NOT appear again — it only shows on a first visit.

## Element Hints

- The consent dialog appears only on a first visit (it is remembered afterwards),
  so the test must cope with it being present OR absent — dismiss it if it is
  there, then continue.
- The report button is labelled "Open account report".

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

The account report is opened (its text is shown), regardless of whether the
consent dialog happened to appear this time.

